lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Mineral County came in under 90% of normal in September to October and October to November in 34 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, April to May ran 162% of normal and November to December just 47%. May to June is the wettest pair at 7.90 inches, January to February the driest at 4.82. Grid 23605 had its driest year in 1991 at 73%.</p>"}
